  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened social protection system in line with minimum standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO will support efforts of the Government and relevant stakeholders of Turkmenistan in strengthening the social protection system. UN interagency joint efforts will be undertaken for a comprehensive social protection assessment to review social protection coverage and gaps, benefit adequacy, but also good governance principles and practices. A comparative study of the legislation of Turkmenistan with regard to national social protection provisions and the provisions of the Social Security (Minimum Standards) Convention, 1952 (No. 102) will be facilitated for subsequent review and validation of the results by the national constituents and their further steps in ratification.</narrative>
  </description>
